OL,3,ASpain sees widespread disruption in
OL,4,Afirst general strike for 14 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport and other public services
OL,7,Facross Spain have faced serious
OL,8,Fdisruption in the first general strike
OL,9,Ffor 14 years called by the main unions
OL,10,Fover housing and the high cost of
OL,11,Fliving.
OL,13,FDemonstrations have taken place across
OL,14,Fthe country, including in Madrid and
OL,15,FBarcelona, where tens of thousands
OL,16,Fmarched in the evening.
OL,18,FSpaniards are due to vote in
OL,19,Fparliamentary elections on 29 November.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
