OL,3,ASpain sees widespread disruption in
OL,4,Afirst general strike for 14 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the big UGT labour union,
OL,7,FPepe Alvarez, said the strike was a
OL,8,Fsuccess with "massive" participation,
OL,9,Fwhile Unai Sordo of the CC OO union
OL,10,Fsaid turnout was "very significant."
